WEBVTT

00:03:59.996 --> 00:04:02.276
is this one here, this woman.

00:04:03.036 --> 00:04:05.556
She's a 71-year-old woman in New Jersey.

00:04:05.596 --> 00:04:06.756
"When I was a kid,

00:04:06.796 --> 00:04:09.756
my mother would send me
to a small local store for a few items.

00:04:09.796 --> 00:04:13.196
I frequently would steal a candy bar
when the grocer wasn't looking.

00:04:13.236 --> 00:04:15.836
That's bothered me for about 60 years."

00:04:16.476 --> 00:04:19.076
So 71-year-old woman in New Jersey,

00:04:19.116 --> 00:04:22.836
for 60 years, she's been bugged
by this moral breach.

00:04:22.836 --> 00:04:25.276
So moral regrets.

00:04:25.316 --> 00:04:26.996
We have people regretting bullying,

00:04:27.036 --> 00:04:29.276
we have people regretting
marital infidelity.

00:04:29.316 --> 00:04:30.916
All kinds of things.